---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — cube27"
  description="cube27's privacy policy and approach to protecting personal data."
>
  <main
    class="bg-cube27-background-primary px-5 py-20 text-cube27-text-primary sm:px-8 lg:py-28"
  >
    <article class="prose prose-neutral mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p
        class="not-prose typography-eyebrow text-xs uppercase text-cube27-accent-primary"
      >
        Legal
      </p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated: 21 September 2024</strong></p>
      <p>
        cube27 values your privacy and is committed to safeguarding personal
        data. This policy explains how cube27 collects, uses, stores, and
        protects information when you use our website, products, and services.
      </p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you contact us or express interest in our services, we may collect
        your name, email address, phone number, company details, message, and
        related communication history. We may also collect limited device and
        usage information needed to operate and secure the website.
      </p>
      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>
        We use personal data to respond to enquiries, provide and improve
        services, communicate with you, protect our systems, and meet legal
        obligations. We do not sell personal data.
      </p>
      <h2>Security and retention</h2>
      <p>
        cube27 uses reasonable technical and organisational safeguards,
        including access controls and encrypted connections. We retain
        information only for as long as needed for the purpose collected or as
        required by law.
      </p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, correct,
        delete, restrict, or object to processing of your personal data. To make
        a request, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@cube27.com"
          >contact@cube27.com</a
        >.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        cube27, Plot No. 12, Mulberry Gardens 1, Magarpatta City, Hadapsar, Pune
        411013, India. Email: <a href="mailto:contact@cube27.com"
          >contact@cube27.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
